WEBVTT

00:21.960 --> 00:23.960
Nail that sign firmly.

00:24.040 --> 00:26.320
-Okay.
-And two more coats of paint on the sign.

00:26.400 --> 00:28.120
Don't worry. I have enough paint.

00:28.200 --> 00:29.800
-Apply a layer of wax on it.
-Mom.

00:29.880 --> 00:31.320
They'll promote our Vacuum Chicken.

00:31.400 --> 00:32.680
Already? I'm not ready yet.

00:32.759 --> 00:33.600
-Hello, ma'am.
-Hello.

00:33.680 --> 00:35.400
No worries, they'll gather some materials

00:35.480 --> 00:37.320
and discuss tomorrow's shooting.

00:37.400 --> 00:38.720
Are we having a meeting first?

00:38.800 --> 00:39.840
Please, come inside.

00:39.920 --> 00:41.000
-Okay.
-Thank you, ma'am.

00:41.520 --> 00:43.760
We'll be counting on you
to promote us online.

00:44.360 --> 00:45.880
Make sure to capture more close-ups

00:45.960 --> 00:47.080
of the awards on our walls.

00:47.160 --> 00:48.760
-Thank you.
-All right.

00:48.840 --> 00:50.200
We'll shoot here.

00:50.280 --> 00:51.320
Stand over there.

00:51.400 --> 00:52.640
Everyone!

00:53.160 --> 00:54.040
Zhuang Jie.

00:54.120 --> 00:55.320
-Zhuang Jie is here.
-Zhuang Jie is here.

00:55.400 --> 00:56.960
Our store will be ready tomorrow.

00:57.040 --> 00:59.040
Here, take these 20% off vouchers.

00:59.120 --> 00:59.960
-Great.
-Thank you.

01:00.040 --> 01:01.600
Come by anytime you want some chicken.

01:01.680 --> 01:03.800
Whatever happens won't affect

01:03.880 --> 01:05.600
Liaogen Chicken's quality and taste.

01:05.680 --> 01:07.120
It's okay to call our family unlucky.

01:07.200 --> 01:09.040
But the chicken
didn't do anything to anyone.

01:09.120 --> 01:10.800
Nonsense. We're all neighbors.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.240
No one will say such things.

01:12.320 --> 01:13.720
That's right. Times have changed.

01:13.800 --> 01:15.280
No one believes that nonsense.

01:15.360 --> 01:16.680
Is every voucher 20% off?

01:17.320 --> 01:18.600
-Then give me two.
-No problem.

01:18.680 --> 01:20.120
Here you go. You can take three.

01:21.240 --> 01:22.560
Thank you, everyone.

01:22.640 --> 01:25.320
Our newly launched Vacuum Chicken
will be available next week

01:25.400 --> 01:26.280
with a 50% discount.

01:26.360 --> 01:28.160
Feel free to order
for your family and friends.

01:28.240 --> 01:29.320
We'll cover delivery fees.

01:29.400 --> 01:30.480
Help us spread the word.

01:30.560 --> 01:31.840
-Okay!
-Thank you.

01:32.840 --> 01:33.960
Good luck with your business.

01:34.480 --> 01:35.360
What a great deal.

01:35.440 --> 01:37.080
Let's buy a few more chickens.

02:56.360 --> 03:01.080
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:17.400 --> 03:19.960
UNDERSTANDING CHILDREN

03:20.040 --> 03:21.800
Isn't it too late for you

03:21.880 --> 03:23.160
to be reading these books?

03:23.240 --> 03:24.680
Don't disturb me.

03:24.760 --> 03:25.760
I just finished reading

03:25.840 --> 03:27.560
about the dangers of rubber nipples.

03:27.640 --> 03:29.880
This one is about potty training.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.960
Maidong is already 30 years old.

03:32.040 --> 03:35.080
You can't expect him
to start over on this.

03:35.720 --> 03:37.000
Don't be ridiculous.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.000
Fine.

03:38.080 --> 03:39.840
Don't waste your energy.

03:39.920 --> 03:41.280
Help me string these beads.

03:41.360 --> 03:43.680
Or I won't be able
to get your gift done in time

03:43.760 --> 03:44.760
for your birthday.

03:45.800 --> 03:47.480
My birthday wish this year

03:47.560 --> 03:50.080
is to read
all the educational books you have here

03:50.160 --> 03:51.880
to find out

03:52.440 --> 03:54.680
what went wrong when we raised Maidong.

03:55.560 --> 03:57.600
Why is he so different from normal people?

03:58.400 --> 04:01.160
You should read more books.

04:01.240 --> 04:03.120
Otherwise, you'll just
keep talking nonsense.

04:03.800 --> 04:06.200
Children are always normal.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.800
It's your mindset that is wrong.

04:07.880 --> 04:09.640
I'm the one who is wrong now, am I?

04:10.480 --> 04:12.800
He's a young man in his thirties

04:12.880 --> 04:13.920
without a girlfriend.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.240
He goes to work and comes home.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.959
Should he just stay single like a monk?

04:17.040 --> 04:20.600
What's so good about marrying
and having children?

04:20.680 --> 04:22.560
You're offending me too.

04:23.280 --> 04:25.480
How can men and women be the same?

04:25.560 --> 04:28.280
Women can live their whole lives
without men.

04:28.360 --> 04:30.480
But men can't live without women.

04:30.560 --> 04:33.600
Your argument has too many flaws.

04:33.680 --> 04:34.840
If you say this online,

04:34.920 --> 04:36.440
you'll definitely be bashed.

04:39.440 --> 04:42.080
Is a lonely life easy?

04:42.920 --> 04:44.400
By the time he gets to my age,

04:44.480 --> 04:45.760
it'll be too late

04:45.840 --> 04:46.760
for regrets.

04:46.840 --> 04:48.680
And what good does it do you,

04:48.760 --> 04:50.120
fussing and worrying so much?

04:50.680 --> 04:51.760
Are you still

04:52.280 --> 04:54.760
thinking of Zhuang Jie?

04:54.840 --> 04:55.680
No.

04:56.960 --> 04:58.560
I feel like a backseat driver.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.360
All my efforts are futile.

05:00.440 --> 05:01.920
That's right.

05:05.880 --> 05:06.840
I smell something burnt.

05:06.920 --> 05:08.760
Quick! Go get my medicine!

05:08.840 --> 05:09.680
All right.

05:13.480 --> 05:15.960
If you can create a new remedy

05:16.560 --> 05:18.040
to cure Maidong's seriousness

05:18.120 --> 05:21.080
so he can be
as lively and smart as others,

05:21.160 --> 05:25.800
you can have the rest of my lifespan.

05:25.880 --> 05:27.160
Thanks.

05:27.680 --> 05:28.920
I can't figure out

05:29.440 --> 05:30.440
that grandson of yours.

05:31.080 --> 05:32.680
I can't do anything about it.

05:35.280 --> 05:37.240
Beat him up.

05:39.960 --> 05:41.400
-Slowly.
-All right.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.320
Tie him up.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.680
Don't make a sound.

05:44.760 --> 05:46.240
-Hurry.
-I'm here.

05:46.320 --> 05:47.280
Zhang Hongxu!

05:55.440 --> 05:56.320
Chen Maidong.

05:57.200 --> 05:58.400
Answer me.

05:58.480 --> 05:59.920
Where is Zhang Hongxu?

06:01.960 --> 06:03.280
He said he was tired

06:03.360 --> 06:05.720
and wanted to experience
what it is like to be a parcel.

06:12.680 --> 06:13.640
Get out!

06:15.080 --> 06:15.960
Give a hand!

06:16.040 --> 06:17.480
Come on.

06:17.560 --> 06:18.480
Come here.

06:20.840 --> 06:21.760
Chen Maidong!

06:22.800 --> 06:23.840
This is all your fault!

06:25.840 --> 06:28.360
Honey, we've been
slaving away half the night.

06:28.440 --> 06:29.560
We wanted to have some fun.

06:29.640 --> 06:30.480
Fun?

06:31.000 --> 06:32.560
Chickens haven't been tagged and loaded.

06:32.640 --> 06:33.920
And you want to play?

06:34.760 --> 06:35.600
Honey,

06:36.320 --> 06:37.520
don't be upset.

06:37.600 --> 06:38.760
It's not good for conception.

06:39.800 --> 06:41.080
I…

06:41.160 --> 06:43.000
These chickens are driving me crazy.

06:43.080 --> 06:45.200
They just keep coming.

06:45.280 --> 06:46.440
The price was slashed so low.

06:46.520 --> 06:48.880
I say we need to deal
with crafty merchants like Zhuang Jie.

06:50.000 --> 06:52.680
What nonsense are you spouting now?

06:53.440 --> 06:54.880
-Here.
-No, you…

06:54.960 --> 06:56.920
I told you to read more books.

06:57.000 --> 06:59.520
Did you?

07:00.800 --> 07:02.600
If we're talking about crafty merchants,

07:02.680 --> 07:04.280
no one can beat you two.

07:05.240 --> 07:08.160
I finally have a night off
and you drag me here to work for free.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.440
Now you're talking, are you?

07:09.520 --> 07:11.080
It's fair for you to do some work.

07:11.160 --> 07:12.360
That's right.

07:12.440 --> 07:15.120
Did you think you could kiss Zhuang Jie
without consequences?

07:15.200 --> 07:16.640
You're not getting out of this.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.160
-Chen Maidong!
-Counterattack.

07:22.080 --> 07:23.720
Sooner or later, I'll show Zhuang Jie

07:23.800 --> 07:24.880
what kind of man you are.

07:24.960 --> 07:27.040
You act like a decent guy in public.

07:27.120 --> 07:28.440
But you're the worst of them all.

07:29.400 --> 07:30.560
What did I do?

07:30.640 --> 07:33.400
I know all those rotten ideas
were all yours.

07:33.480 --> 07:35.400
My husband is a blockhead compared to you.

07:35.480 --> 07:38.040
In the summer, you smashed watermelons,
splattering juice all over.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.240
Did you ever clean the walls?

07:39.320 --> 07:40.160
And in the winter,

07:40.240 --> 07:42.280
you had icicle-eating contests
at the door.

07:42.360 --> 07:43.880
Are you guys crazy?

07:43.960 --> 07:45.480
Why didn't they fall and pierce you?

07:45.560 --> 07:46.400
Okay, stop.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.560
We'll leave, okay?

07:48.120 --> 07:49.040
We're leaving.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.320
Let's go.

07:50.400 --> 07:51.560
Why are you laughing?

07:51.640 --> 07:53.120
Go home to your wife and kids

07:53.200 --> 07:54.280
and do something.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.600
You keep hanging out here.

07:55.680 --> 07:56.760
Is this a game room to you?

07:56.840 --> 07:58.320
Go home if you have a wife.

07:58.400 --> 08:00.160
The bachelor, you stay here.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.360
We have tons of work to do.

08:01.440 --> 08:02.400
Forget it.

08:03.080 --> 08:04.720
He can't even get a wife.

08:04.800 --> 08:05.960
What good is he for?

08:06.040 --> 08:07.000
Even you are better.

08:07.080 --> 08:08.200
How can he compare to me?

08:11.080 --> 08:11.920
Hey, bachelor,

08:12.480 --> 08:13.680
I'm going back to my wife too.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.880
It's the hierarchy.

08:15.960 --> 08:16.800
Just accept it.

08:22.480 --> 08:24.960
Earlier, I mainly shared with everyone

08:25.040 --> 08:26.560
about the popularity model.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.880
That is,

08:27.960 --> 08:29.160
how to use popularity

08:29.240 --> 08:31.240
to increase your authority
and generate traffic.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.880
This is the foundation of e-commerce.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.200
The requirements are quite high.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.679
That's all for today.

08:37.760 --> 08:39.559
All right. Please take notes.

08:39.640 --> 08:40.880
Work hard.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.400
That's all. Goodbye.

08:45.080 --> 08:45.920
Jie,

08:46.600 --> 08:47.440
all the other sellers

08:47.520 --> 08:48.760
have printed shipping labels.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.920
No one handwrites the labels

08:50.000 --> 08:50.840
like us anymore!

08:50.920 --> 08:51.760
DELIVERY DETAILS

08:53.640 --> 08:54.800
The equipment isn't here yet.

08:54.880 --> 08:56.000
Just do it for two more days.

08:56.080 --> 08:58.320
Then why did you
still sell hundreds of chickens?

08:58.400 --> 08:59.800
Isn't that a good thing?

08:59.880 --> 09:01.560
It means online business is worth doing.

09:02.200 --> 09:04.400
They haven't even
formally promoted us yet.

09:04.480 --> 09:06.080
A brief mention in a live stream,

09:06.160 --> 09:07.320
and we get tons of orders.

09:07.400 --> 09:09.240
Zhuang Jie, at this rate,

09:09.320 --> 09:10.800
I think we should expand the factory.

09:13.360 --> 09:15.560
My goodness,
my hands are going to fall off.

09:15.640 --> 09:16.920
He Niaoniao, you're getting paid.

09:17.000 --> 09:17.880
Don't complain.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.840
I didn't know it would be so much work.

09:20.920 --> 09:22.120
It's only 50 cents apiece.

09:22.760 --> 09:24.920
The pay is too low. I protest.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.360
As long as you don't go on strike.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.560
Name your terms.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.280
Jie,

09:34.360 --> 09:36.920
is Liaogen Chicken
getting an official account?

09:37.000 --> 09:37.840
Of course.

09:37.920 --> 09:40.560
Influencers can help us
attract traffic in the initial stage.

09:40.640 --> 09:42.920
We'll need our operations team
down the line.

09:43.000 --> 09:44.760
Will someone be
in charge of the live streams?

09:46.360 --> 09:48.120
We'll have to hire professionals.

09:48.200 --> 09:49.320
Either way, it won't be you.

09:49.400 --> 09:50.760
You're still a child.

09:50.840 --> 09:51.920
Get back to work.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.880
l know.

09:53.880 --> 09:55.600
But I know our business best.

09:56.560 --> 09:58.440
I can help with the planning at least.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.920
No.

10:00.000 --> 10:02.120
You're young.
Stop aiming for the limelight.

10:04.640 --> 10:05.720
See, Jie?

10:05.800 --> 10:07.360
Mom always discourages me.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.000
I'll never grow up to be anything.

10:10.720 --> 10:11.560
Mom,

10:11.640 --> 10:12.880
you should change that habit.

10:17.560 --> 10:18.560
Continue your work.

10:18.640 --> 10:19.480
Okay.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.480
Grandma.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.600
Chicken for breakfast again?

10:40.680 --> 10:42.800
We've had it for days
in a row now. I'm sick of it.

10:42.880 --> 10:45.000
Stop complaining when you get food.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.000
Why don't you cook?

10:47.200 --> 10:48.560
You didn't cook the chicken either.

10:49.680 --> 10:51.320
I'm spending a little money

10:51.400 --> 10:53.680
to help Jie and her family
through a rough patch.

10:53.760 --> 10:55.080
Do you have a problem with that?

10:55.840 --> 10:56.800
I wouldn't dare.

10:59.480 --> 11:00.600
You're already a grown-up,

11:00.680 --> 11:01.960
yet you do nothing every day.

11:02.040 --> 11:04.640
This old lady has to do
everything for you. And you?

11:04.720 --> 11:06.240
You complain whenever you open your mouth.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.360
Let's eat. Come on, let's eat.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.680
Chen Maidong,

11:12.360 --> 11:14.520
something so huge happened
to the Zhuang family,

11:14.600 --> 11:16.240
and you don't even care.

11:16.320 --> 11:18.520
You could've bought something
and gone to see them.

11:19.480 --> 11:20.760
The mother and daughter

11:20.840 --> 11:22.560
not only kept the factory going,

11:22.640 --> 11:24.040
but also expanded their business.

11:24.120 --> 11:26.360
They're doing even better than before.

11:27.520 --> 11:29.840
They held up the sky when it fell on them.

11:29.920 --> 11:31.920
They're real heroines.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.400
One in a million.

11:33.480 --> 11:37.720
If anyone could marry a woman like Jie,

11:37.800 --> 11:40.200
they ought to go light incense
at their ancestors' graves.

11:41.080 --> 11:42.160
And you?

11:42.240 --> 11:44.760
You wasted a good deck of cards
dealt to you.

11:47.040 --> 11:48.840
Fine, I won't talk about it anymore.

11:48.920 --> 11:49.800
Let's eat.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.360
What business

11:54.440 --> 11:55.520
did they expand into?

11:56.200 --> 11:58.840
Something about a vacuum chamber.

11:58.920 --> 11:59.840
Pretty advanced stuff.

12:00.360 --> 12:01.200
Vacuum what?

12:02.360 --> 12:03.880
You ask a lot of questions.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.520
Vacuum Chicken.

12:06.120 --> 12:08.760
And something about doing online business.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.640
All that trendy stuff must be Jie's idea.

12:13.520 --> 12:14.600
So is she not leaving?

12:17.600 --> 12:18.680
You have a lot of questions.

12:21.240 --> 12:22.520
Ask her yourself.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.320
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

13:12.320 --> 13:13.280
Hey, Zhuang Jie.

13:24.680 --> 13:27.160
Ms. Lin, keep a close eye on things.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.280
Besides hygiene standards,

13:28.360 --> 13:29.880
safety in production is more important.

13:29.960 --> 13:32.720
HANDWASHING AND SANITIZATION AREA

13:32.800 --> 13:33.960
All right. You get busy.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.160
I'll look at the live stream.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.320
-Okay.
-All right. See you.

13:44.480 --> 13:45.680
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

13:45.760 --> 13:46.920
-You're here, Jie.
-Good work.

13:47.000 --> 13:48.480
-Hey, Jie.
-Good work.

13:54.120 --> 13:55.320
Everything is ready, Jie.

13:55.400 --> 13:57.280
-Okay.
-Okay, let's get started.

13:57.840 --> 13:59.480
Hi, everyone. Welcome to my live stream.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.000
Today, I'm introducing

14:01.080 --> 14:02.280
Liaogen Chicken.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.040
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

14:04.120 --> 14:06.000
One chicken liver.
Six pairs of chicken wings.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.200
Here you go.

14:07.280 --> 14:08.120
Thank you.

14:08.200 --> 14:10.200
Your daughter is really something.

14:10.280 --> 14:11.480
She's so capable.

14:12.880 --> 14:13.840
She's all right.

14:13.920 --> 14:15.440
What else can we do?

14:15.520 --> 14:16.400
It's just us now.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.360
Take care.

14:17.440 --> 14:19.000
-I've paid.
-All right.

14:22.880 --> 14:24.440
How is your leg?

14:24.520 --> 14:25.400
Everyone in town

14:25.480 --> 14:26.760
has seen you zooming around.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.280
It's like you're teleporting.

14:28.360 --> 14:29.240
I'm fine.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.480
I drive an electric scooter.

14:30.560 --> 14:32.520
You drive like you're flying.

14:33.160 --> 14:34.040
That's not safe.

14:34.600 --> 14:37.040
Maybe we should buy a used truck.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.600
Neither of us has a driving license.

14:38.680 --> 14:40.520
Zhuang Yan won't come back.
Who will drive it?

14:40.600 --> 14:42.640
Keep it this way for now.
I'll make a few more trips.

14:42.720 --> 14:44.200
Then we'll hire a delivery person.

14:44.280 --> 14:46.400
Focus on live streams and shipping.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.880
Who was the one who taught me,

14:47.960 --> 14:49.640
"It's not just chicken we deliver

14:49.720 --> 14:50.640
but the human touch"?

14:50.720 --> 14:53.040
It's not the same
if we hire someone else to do it.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.880
Doing this work reminds me of

14:54.960 --> 14:56.360
the benefit of having a man around.

14:57.000 --> 14:59.520
It's one thing if I don't have one,
but you won't find one either.

15:00.280 --> 15:02.480
This conversation
is veering towards dangerous territory.

15:02.560 --> 15:04.320
Let's not discuss this further. Stop now.

15:05.640 --> 15:06.840
You'll work yourself to death.

15:09.520 --> 15:11.360
This is nothing.
I consider it an exercise.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.720
Wang Xixia even envies me.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.440
She says I naturally have low body fat.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.720
Speaking of Xixia,

15:16.800 --> 15:18.400
people said a while ago

15:18.480 --> 15:19.640
at the train station,

15:19.720 --> 15:21.400
there was a fashionable girl

15:21.480 --> 15:23.200
with Chen Maidong from the funeral parlor,

15:23.280 --> 15:24.760
your classmate.

15:24.840 --> 15:25.800
What about them?

15:27.320 --> 15:28.560
They kissed passionately.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.200
Kissed…

15:37.280 --> 15:38.240
Kissed passionately?

15:38.880 --> 15:40.640
Do you even know
what a passionate kiss is?

15:41.120 --> 15:43.480
I do. Just hearing about it made me blush.

15:43.560 --> 15:46.520
But they said the girl was very stylish.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.240
And she works in a big city. Is it Xixia?

15:48.320 --> 15:49.400
It's not her.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.240
How do you know it's not her?

15:51.960 --> 15:53.160
Have you heard about this too?

15:54.120 --> 15:55.400
No, but…

15:55.480 --> 15:57.560
She has been going
on arranged dates in Shanghai.

15:57.640 --> 15:58.600
How could it be her?

16:00.280 --> 16:01.640
Who could it be, then?

16:01.720 --> 16:05.560
Chen Maidong looks
like a good, mature boy.

16:05.640 --> 16:07.760
It's probably the girl who has no shame.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.840
Why do you care?

16:10.920 --> 16:12.720
They kissed. So what?

16:13.680 --> 16:15.640
Don't talk behind someone's back.

16:16.280 --> 16:17.400
Who is?

16:17.480 --> 16:19.520
They brought it up, so I listened.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.960
As if I like to spread this around.

16:22.120 --> 16:22.960
Give me a hand.

16:24.520 --> 16:25.400
I'll do it.

16:27.040 --> 16:28.480
We're having hot pot again tonight.

16:28.560 --> 16:30.120
Buy some spinach on your way back.

16:30.960 --> 16:32.960
Can we have something else?
It's hot pot every day.

16:33.040 --> 16:34.360
He Niaoniao is sick of it.

16:35.000 --> 16:36.920
You get food. Don't complain.

16:37.000 --> 16:38.040
I'm dog-tired.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.800
Who has the time and energy to cook?

16:39.880 --> 16:41.680
I wish I had a secret housekeeper.

16:41.760 --> 16:42.880
Here, I'll handle that.

16:42.960 --> 16:43.840
Okay.

16:44.800 --> 16:45.680
Here you go.

17:03.200 --> 17:04.720
I'm starving.

17:04.800 --> 17:05.880
I'm starving.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.400
I'm starving.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.800
Let's have instant noodles.

17:08.880 --> 17:09.760
-Sure.
-Sure.

17:10.440 --> 17:11.280
Throw in a sausage.

17:11.359 --> 17:12.520
And an egg.

17:12.599 --> 17:13.480
Okay.

17:46.640 --> 17:47.600
What's the matter?

17:48.640 --> 17:49.920
Go wash up and come eat.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.600
My goodness! Heavens!

17:51.680 --> 17:53.760
Braised pork, shrimp, and fish!

17:54.960 --> 17:56.040
-Xixia!
-Wang Xixia.

17:56.120 --> 17:57.720
Are you the secret housekeeper?

17:57.800 --> 18:00.480
-You're a lifesaver!
-You are!

18:00.560 --> 18:02.200
It's a special occasion
when Xixia is back.

18:02.280 --> 18:03.200
We must have a drink.

18:03.280 --> 18:05.760
-Okay.
-Why didn't you tell me? You surprised me.

18:05.840 --> 18:06.720
All right.

18:06.800 --> 18:09.440
-You're going to drink with me tonight.
-No problem.

18:09.520 --> 18:11.800
An entire spread of fatty foods.
What will you eat?

18:11.880 --> 18:12.920
Are you crazy?

18:13.000 --> 18:14.680
Who sticks to a diet when they're home?

18:14.760 --> 18:15.760
Eat everything!

18:15.840 --> 18:17.080
-Drink!
-What do I drink?

18:17.160 --> 18:18.000
Soup.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.000
-Here.
-Here.

18:20.080 --> 18:21.680
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

18:21.760 --> 18:23.920
-Cheers.
-Thank you.

18:27.200 --> 18:28.400
You're not young anymore!

18:28.480 --> 18:29.480
Don't knock it back!

18:29.560 --> 18:30.880
I'm only 73.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.000
A young lady.

18:32.800 --> 18:34.240
Only 73?

18:34.320 --> 18:35.200
I'm 84.

18:35.280 --> 18:37.360
We'll go to Yama in due time.

18:39.040 --> 18:40.280
Touch wood!

18:40.360 --> 18:41.200
Fine.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.800
You spoiled me.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.360
No old lady
would celebrate their birthday like this.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.640
What difference
does being an old lady make?

18:49.720 --> 18:51.560
Some wrinkles won't make you worthless.

18:55.360 --> 18:57.360
This is completely unnecessary.

18:57.440 --> 18:58.920
I know very well

18:59.000 --> 19:00.920
what is inside.

19:06.280 --> 19:07.480
This thing looks erotic

19:07.560 --> 19:10.080
in the dim light of the night.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.800
Are you serious?

19:12.880 --> 19:14.280
Is this really my lucky color?

19:14.360 --> 19:15.960
I would never pull a prank on you.

19:16.040 --> 19:17.040
We are Scorpios.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.760
This is who we are.

19:18.840 --> 19:20.720
Remember to wear it every day.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.840
You might just get lucky.

19:22.920 --> 19:24.520
I can't wear it, then.

19:24.600 --> 19:25.760
Maidong can have it instead.

19:25.840 --> 19:27.600
Our birthday is on the same day.

19:27.680 --> 19:28.920
He is also a Scorpio.

19:29.880 --> 19:30.760
If you have good luck,

19:30.840 --> 19:32.840
your grandson will have it too.

19:33.320 --> 19:34.200
You have a point.

19:34.880 --> 19:36.040
If I do well in life,

19:36.120 --> 19:37.400
it will do him some good.

19:39.240 --> 19:40.640
Maidong has a tough life.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.800
His parents failed him.

19:42.880 --> 19:44.560
The divorce was a disaster.

19:45.560 --> 19:47.200
It's no wonder

19:47.280 --> 19:48.840
he was traumatized.

19:48.920 --> 19:49.760
Goodness.

19:49.840 --> 19:52.120
On your last birthday,

19:52.200 --> 19:54.400
you said Maidong was getting depressed

19:54.480 --> 19:56.240
because of Song Yi.

19:56.800 --> 19:57.960
Now that they broke up,

19:58.440 --> 19:59.560
you're blaming others.

19:59.640 --> 20:01.400
She was responsible in some way.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.560
Maidong didn't

20:02.640 --> 20:03.520
meet the right one.

20:03.600 --> 20:05.200
You are a year older now.

20:05.280 --> 20:08.120
You're a mature old lady.

20:08.200 --> 20:10.080
Stop complaining all the time.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.080
Fine.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.280
Come on.

20:12.360 --> 20:13.200
Blow out the candle.

20:18.600 --> 20:19.720
Time to make a wish.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.480
Happy birthday!

20:29.560 --> 20:30.680
Happy birthday!

20:30.760 --> 20:31.800
Cut the cake.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.040
Wait.

20:34.120 --> 20:35.320
I need to use the toilet.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.600
Everything here is nice.

20:36.680 --> 20:37.960
But after sitting a while,

20:38.040 --> 20:39.720
my legs hurt when I stand up.

20:39.800 --> 20:41.600
-Be careful.
-Sit down.

20:45.520 --> 20:46.720
Whenever I see these pictures,

20:46.800 --> 20:48.280
the urge to use the toilet

20:48.360 --> 20:49.800
gets even stronger.

20:49.880 --> 20:52.640
You should steer clear
of what you shouldn't see.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.600
Then you'll have ease of mind.

20:58.280 --> 20:59.800
I don't get it.

20:59.880 --> 21:02.280
Why must a man dress like this?

21:17.320 --> 21:18.200
Xixia,

21:18.680 --> 21:20.760
why are you suddenly on a break as well?

21:20.840 --> 21:22.840
I thought you and Zhuang Jie

21:22.920 --> 21:24.200
were the model employees.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
A higher-up from France

21:27.520 --> 21:29.160
dropped into our company.

21:29.240 --> 21:30.960
He bosses us around.

21:31.040 --> 21:33.080
He's annoying. It's better not to see him.

21:33.800 --> 21:35.160
Yes.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.160
We never put up

21:36.240 --> 21:37.640
with mistreatment in any form.

21:39.800 --> 21:42.200
Are you spending your New Year here?

21:42.280 --> 21:44.440
My brother keeps pushing me to get a visa.

21:44.520 --> 21:45.680
He wants me to go to Canada

21:45.760 --> 21:46.800
to visit my nephew.

21:46.880 --> 21:49.240
He's three and still hasn't met me.

21:50.600 --> 21:51.480
What about your dad?

21:52.000 --> 21:54.080
Are you and your brother

21:54.160 --> 21:55.520
never going to see him again?

21:56.080 --> 21:58.360
We only had our mom
and not our dad when we were kids.

21:58.440 --> 22:00.560
Now our mom is gone.

22:00.640 --> 22:01.880
I'll pretend he never existed.

22:07.240 --> 22:08.360
Not all parents

22:08.440 --> 22:09.600
deserve to be loved.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.760
People have children

22:11.840 --> 22:12.840
out of selfishness,

22:12.920 --> 22:14.080
not good karma.

22:14.160 --> 22:15.520
If the parents are good,

22:15.600 --> 22:16.880
they can have some attention.

22:16.960 --> 22:18.480
But if they are not worthy,

22:18.560 --> 22:19.800
stay away from them.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.760
They are bad luck.

22:22.000 --> 22:23.640
Well said, Godmother.

22:23.720 --> 22:25.600
Indeed. You're always full of surprises.

22:25.680 --> 22:27.040
However,

22:27.120 --> 22:29.280
you can still choose the right partner.

22:29.360 --> 22:30.760
You need to plan for your future.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.360
Oh no. Here she goes again.

22:33.960 --> 22:35.240
She isn't wrong.

22:36.080 --> 22:37.720
You need real efforts to find true love.

22:37.800 --> 22:38.880
Don't just wait for one

22:38.960 --> 22:40.080
to knock on your door.

22:40.160 --> 22:41.600
That's not dignity but laziness.

22:44.080 --> 22:45.160
Cheers.

22:46.640 --> 22:48.960
Mom, don't fall for her fancy words.

22:49.040 --> 22:50.120
She may look smart,

22:50.200 --> 22:52.040
but she is hopeless when it comes to men.

22:52.120 --> 22:55.280
Girls always complain after a blind date.

22:55.360 --> 22:56.480
But her?

22:56.560 --> 22:58.080
She is fine with all of her dates

22:58.160 --> 22:59.640
and thinks she can marry them.

23:00.560 --> 23:02.240
Xixia, that is not good.

23:04.360 --> 23:05.640
You have no idea.

23:06.640 --> 23:08.480
She ruined my chances

23:08.560 --> 23:10.320
with all of my potential future husbands.

23:10.400 --> 23:12.560
Last time, there was a guy in finance.

23:12.640 --> 23:14.080
He claimed to be 175 cm tall,

23:14.160 --> 23:15.880
but he had height-boosting insoles.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.720
Don't height-shame the man.

23:17.800 --> 23:18.920
It's all genetic.

23:19.000 --> 23:20.200
What matters is the character.

23:20.280 --> 23:21.120
Yes.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.040
But Xixia,

23:22.560 --> 23:24.800
his height
does affect the future generation.

23:24.880 --> 23:27.120
I also met a guy who owns a cinema.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.920
He never stopped talking.

23:29.000 --> 23:29.920
He wouldn't shut up

23:30.000 --> 23:31.360
throughout the entire meal.

23:31.440 --> 23:32.840
Didn't that give you a headache?

23:32.920 --> 23:35.120
A man shouldn't talk that much.
It's excessive.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.200
Fine.

23:36.280 --> 23:38.360
Months ago, I met a guy who is an artist.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.760
He paints.

23:39.840 --> 23:40.880
Never get an artist!

23:40.960 --> 23:42.400
Don't bring another Zhuang Yan home.

23:42.480 --> 23:43.480
It's misery.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.440
Wang Xixia,

23:45.520 --> 23:46.440
admit it.

23:46.520 --> 23:48.160
You have bad taste.

23:48.840 --> 23:51.200
But I think life can still go on anyway.

23:51.280 --> 23:53.560
With love, we can make it work.

23:53.640 --> 23:54.520
Don't be so sure.

23:54.600 --> 23:56.440
Fate plays a big part in a relationship.

23:56.520 --> 23:57.680
Yes.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.520
But we can't be too picky.

24:01.960 --> 24:02.960
Life is tough.

24:04.000 --> 24:06.000
Life is so tough.

24:09.840 --> 24:11.960
There is a female celebrity I like.

24:12.040 --> 24:13.800
During an interview,

24:13.880 --> 24:14.760
she was asked,

24:14.840 --> 24:16.240
"What do you think of men?"

24:16.320 --> 24:17.200
She replied,

24:17.960 --> 24:18.800
"I don't."

24:20.560 --> 24:22.240
She earned my respect instantly.

24:23.120 --> 24:24.240
I don't think

24:24.320 --> 24:26.480
I've met a lot of good men.

24:26.560 --> 24:28.840
I have no idea how to pick.

24:30.080 --> 24:30.920
True enough.

24:31.600 --> 24:33.160
I've had two marriages

24:33.240 --> 24:34.680
and a son.

24:35.520 --> 24:38.040
I still think I know nothing about men.

24:48.800 --> 24:50.080
Hello?

24:52.000 --> 24:53.200
We are closed.

24:53.280 --> 24:54.240
No more deliveries.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.320
You are…

25:05.600 --> 25:08.440
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

25:09.000 --> 25:10.240
Ms. Lin?

25:10.320 --> 25:11.320
Mrs. Chen?

25:11.400 --> 25:12.480
Welcome, Jie.

25:14.360 --> 25:16.560
Sorry, the food went cold on the way.

25:16.640 --> 25:17.800
You should heat it up.

25:17.880 --> 25:20.360
It doesn't matter. It's for tomorrow.

25:20.440 --> 25:22.280
Sorry for troubling you to make this trip.

25:22.360 --> 25:23.640
How much is this?

25:23.720 --> 25:24.560
It's on the house.

25:24.640 --> 25:26.120
Mrs. Chen talks about you a lot.

25:26.200 --> 25:28.240
You made us little cakes the other day.

25:28.320 --> 25:29.160
We're even.

25:30.120 --> 25:32.080
Jie, I ordered the food

25:32.160 --> 25:33.240
so you could be here

25:33.320 --> 25:34.680
to pick Mrs. Chen up

25:34.760 --> 25:36.320
and send her home.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.520
It's her birthday.

25:37.600 --> 25:38.720
She had a little alcohol.

25:38.800 --> 25:40.880
I can't let her walk home on her own.

25:41.960 --> 25:42.960
Maidong is busy.

25:43.040 --> 25:44.600
I had no choice

25:44.680 --> 25:46.080
but to ask you for a favor.

25:46.160 --> 25:47.800
Ms. Lin, if you ever need help,

25:47.880 --> 25:48.840
don't place an order.

25:48.920 --> 25:50.760
I am only one call away.

25:51.480 --> 25:55.480
See? Jie is the finest girl around.

25:56.880 --> 25:58.840
All right. I'll send her home.

26:01.480 --> 26:02.520
Are you drunk?

26:02.600 --> 26:04.520
No, not me. I'm not.

26:04.600 --> 26:05.960
Call me if you need anything.

26:15.200 --> 26:17.440
Mrs. Chen, happy birthday.

26:18.080 --> 26:19.400
You should've told me.

26:19.480 --> 26:22.040
I would've prepared a present.

26:22.120 --> 26:23.360
I have no need for that.

26:23.880 --> 26:25.680
All I need is to see you.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.320
How much did you two drink?

26:29.400 --> 26:30.520
Why do you care?

26:30.600 --> 26:31.560
Exactly.

26:34.960 --> 26:36.960
Mrs. Chen, is this a new bracelet?

26:37.040 --> 26:38.280
It's pretty.

26:40.000 --> 26:41.160
Ms. Lin gave this to me

26:41.240 --> 26:42.600
as a birthday present.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.480
She said this is my lucky color.

26:46.800 --> 26:47.720
It looks nice.

26:50.320 --> 26:52.840
Why didn't Chen Maidong
celebrate your birthday with you?

26:53.880 --> 26:55.000
The better way to put it

26:55.080 --> 26:58.520
is that I didn't
celebrate his birthday with him.

26:59.320 --> 27:00.480
Do you have the same birthday?

27:01.880 --> 27:02.720
What are the odds?

27:03.640 --> 27:05.120
In the past,

27:05.200 --> 27:06.880
we celebrated it together.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.520
But for some reason,

27:10.600 --> 27:12.400
I didn't even receive a call from him.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.600
He's probably too busy.

27:15.600 --> 27:19.000
So, I brought a piece of cake for him.

27:19.080 --> 27:20.200
We'll finish it tomorrow.

27:21.040 --> 27:22.440
I'll make it up to him.

27:27.720 --> 27:29.640
Mrs. Chen, I'll deliver the cake.

27:30.320 --> 27:31.680
It's his 30th birthday.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.640
He has to at least have a piece of cake.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.280
Do you mean it?

27:56.040 --> 27:58.720
I entrusted her to you!

27:58.800 --> 28:01.520
How did this happen?

28:02.400 --> 28:03.720
I want my daughter back!

28:03.800 --> 28:04.840
Mom!

28:06.200 --> 28:08.480
She never stopped crying.

28:08.560 --> 28:10.520
She was sick for a very long time!

28:10.600 --> 28:11.840
Hu Liyan!

28:11.920 --> 28:13.840
You're a heartless wretch!

28:13.920 --> 28:14.920
What did you do?

28:15.000 --> 28:16.640
Why would my sister abandon her kid

28:16.720 --> 28:18.200
and take her own life?

28:18.280 --> 28:20.720
I didn't force her to commit suicide!

28:20.800 --> 28:22.960
Right? I have nothing
to gain from her death!

28:24.680 --> 28:27.000
My daughter was only 36!

28:27.080 --> 28:29.760
Had she not
met a good-for-nothing like you,

28:29.840 --> 28:31.520
she would still be…

28:32.200 --> 28:34.240
Mom!

28:34.320 --> 28:35.840
-Mom!
-What's wrong?

28:36.520 --> 28:37.520
What are you doing?

28:37.600 --> 28:38.560
Beat him up!

28:38.640 --> 28:39.720
Stop fighting!

28:39.800 --> 28:41.120
-We'll call the police!
-Stop it!

28:41.200 --> 28:42.560
Calm down! Stop fighting!

28:42.640 --> 28:43.720
Hit him!

28:43.800 --> 28:45.040
-Stop it!
-Beat him!

28:45.120 --> 28:46.720
-Beat him up!
-Stop fighting!

28:46.800 --> 28:48.160
-Stop!
-What are you doing?

28:49.000 --> 28:49.880
Stop fighting!

28:50.480 --> 28:51.720
Back off!

28:51.800 --> 28:52.680
Stop it! Stop!

28:52.760 --> 28:54.240
-What are you doing?
-Why are you here?

28:54.320 --> 28:55.640
Wait! Are you out of your mind?

28:55.720 --> 28:57.680
You were just standing!
You were tough in school!

28:57.760 --> 28:58.720
Stay out of this. Go!

28:58.800 --> 28:59.720
Stop it!

29:08.920 --> 29:10.000
Calm down!

29:19.360 --> 29:21.960
Only I get to hit women,

29:22.920 --> 29:24.400
not the other way around.

29:30.040 --> 29:31.080
Don't make me hurt you.

29:43.040 --> 29:43.880
Cousin?

29:44.520 --> 29:45.960
Why are you here?

29:51.920 --> 29:53.160
You even brought some helpers.

29:53.920 --> 29:56.240
I didn't know
you had a reputation in Nanping.

29:56.880 --> 29:57.800
Watch your mouth.

30:00.320 --> 30:02.080
Your wife just passed away.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.920
Is this how you should behave?

30:04.520 --> 30:05.640
Do you even have a heart?

30:05.720 --> 30:07.280
Cousin.

30:16.120 --> 30:19.080
I apologize on behalf of my cousin.

30:27.240 --> 30:28.240
I can take it from here.

30:28.320 --> 30:29.520
Stop his bleeding.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.560
Don't stuff the nose.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.600
Lower his head.

30:38.680 --> 30:39.560
Put an ice pack on it.

30:41.560 --> 30:43.320
Feng Xilun, handle it.

30:46.640 --> 30:47.680
Everyone, calm down.

30:47.760 --> 30:49.200
Why don't we sit and talk it over?

30:55.600 --> 30:56.680
Has it been ten minutes?

30:57.960 --> 30:58.880
You're suffocating me.

31:05.440 --> 31:06.520
The bleeding stopped.

31:06.600 --> 31:07.920
Get up. Your legs must be numb.

31:08.880 --> 31:10.920
My legs are doing better than your brain.

31:11.000 --> 31:13.040
I work here. What else could I do?

31:13.680 --> 31:14.880
But I heard you threaten

31:14.960 --> 31:15.960
to hit the hooligan.

31:16.040 --> 31:17.600
Because he wanted to hit you.

31:22.040 --> 31:22.880
Forget it.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.240
If your grandma is right,

31:24.320 --> 31:25.240
a little bleeding

31:25.320 --> 31:26.720
might be your lucky color.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.400
Nonsense.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.040
Chen Maidong,

31:32.800 --> 31:33.720
happy birthday.

31:36.400 --> 31:38.080
I think I smooshed it earlier.

31:39.160 --> 31:40.120
Don't you want this?

31:41.440 --> 31:42.640
Thank you.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.400
What for?

31:45.000 --> 31:47.520
For the cake or for saving your neck?

31:48.680 --> 31:49.640
Both.

31:51.680 --> 31:52.680
Don't be smug.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.920
Your grandma asked me
to deliver this cake.

31:55.000 --> 31:56.400
I came on her behalf.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.560
I should thank her.

32:00.400 --> 32:01.760
And I wish her a happy birthday.

32:02.320 --> 32:03.440
She is happy.

32:03.520 --> 32:05.760
She had a drink and got a present.

32:05.840 --> 32:06.960
Really?

32:07.040 --> 32:08.320
I thought you were the drunk one.

32:09.840 --> 32:10.680
Can you smell it?

32:12.600 --> 32:13.760
Go away.

32:13.840 --> 32:15.320
I'll pass out from the fumes.

32:18.000 --> 32:20.040
If you faint,
it won't be because of the alcohol,

32:20.600 --> 32:22.040
but because of my beautiful face.

32:23.040 --> 32:24.600
I think you really are drunk.

32:25.400 --> 32:27.800
People might think
you're here to stir up trouble.

32:28.360 --> 32:29.360
You can put it that way.

32:30.280 --> 32:32.560
Why else would I hit that guy
for you in my condition?

32:34.720 --> 32:36.080
Yes, no one has ever done that.

32:39.080 --> 32:40.600
Here, have some cake.

32:40.680 --> 32:41.720
Make this trip worthwhile.

32:42.400 --> 32:44.360
I can still taste blood. You eat it.

32:44.960 --> 32:45.800
Take a bite.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.120
-No.
-Eat it.

33:05.360 --> 33:06.280
Who is this?

33:08.040 --> 33:09.640
The woman who died is his mother.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.320
She's in there.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.720
The driver fell asleep.

34:04.000 --> 34:05.080
Text me when you reach home.

34:07.080 --> 34:07.960
Chen Maidong,

34:08.840 --> 34:10.120
what present would you like?

34:10.199 --> 34:11.800
It is your 30th birthday.

34:14.480 --> 34:15.360
Well…

34:16.239 --> 34:17.520
Buy me some clothes.

34:18.280 --> 34:20.280
I'm needed here. I can't leave.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.760
Can't you shop online?

34:23.199 --> 34:24.320
No.

34:27.000 --> 34:28.920
So be it.
You even asked for more than one.

34:29.000 --> 34:30.800
You made quite a greedy wish.

34:31.760 --> 34:32.719
I'll pay.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.239
Sure.

34:34.320 --> 34:35.239
I'll keep the change.

34:36.199 --> 34:37.239
What do you want?

34:38.760 --> 34:39.920
I'll send it to you later.

34:52.360 --> 34:53.760
Sir?

34:53.840 --> 34:54.679
Time to go.

34:59.560 --> 35:00.440
Go inside.

35:00.520 --> 35:01.520
It's cold out here.

35:34.840 --> 35:35.960
Do you often get

35:36.040 --> 35:37.320
this kind of trouble at work?

35:37.800 --> 35:39.160
It's the first time in our town.

35:39.760 --> 35:40.760
It's usually the elderly

35:40.840 --> 35:41.880
who die of natural causes.

35:42.840 --> 35:44.360
My last workplace

35:44.440 --> 35:45.560
was worse.

35:45.640 --> 35:46.520
How so?

35:48.440 --> 35:49.560
Do you want to know?

35:49.640 --> 35:50.840
It wouldn't hurt to know.

35:51.440 --> 35:54.000
I had to sew a dismembered body
back together.

35:55.440 --> 35:57.280
I went to horrible crime scenes.

35:58.400 --> 35:59.280
The worst of them all

36:00.800 --> 36:02.600
was a person who died in a basement.

36:03.680 --> 36:04.720
It was summer.

36:05.600 --> 36:07.200
The body was only found after two weeks.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.720
I'm not looking down on your job.

36:14.400 --> 36:15.800
But I am worried.

36:16.440 --> 36:19.000
It's just like when people know
about my disability.

36:19.720 --> 36:22.600
No matter how polite or tactful they are,

36:23.200 --> 36:24.680
it still affects their perception.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.920
People like me

36:28.560 --> 36:30.240
are destined to suffer stigmas.

36:57.440 --> 36:59.120
How did you get through it?

36:59.200 --> 37:00.800
Turn the disadvantage into my advantage.

37:02.280 --> 37:04.120
When I was a salesperson,

37:04.200 --> 37:07.640
anyone who knew about my condition
would never give me attitude.

37:11.040 --> 37:11.880
Impressive.

37:12.360 --> 37:13.920
You're the one who told me.

37:14.440 --> 37:16.320
"Even a crutch can be used as a weapon."

37:49.960 --> 37:51.360
Why aren't you sleeping yet?

37:52.000 --> 37:53.200
Why were you out so late?

37:56.200 --> 37:57.840
I was talking to Chen Maidong.

37:58.400 --> 37:59.400
What are you watching?

38:00.200 --> 38:01.840
I found this in your watch history.

38:09.920 --> 38:12.680
These people are incredible.

38:13.240 --> 38:15.000
The first three episodes were thrilling.

38:15.080 --> 38:18.160
There were highly-decomposed bodies
and bodies from accidents.

38:18.240 --> 38:21.200
These morticians have to work days on end.

38:21.280 --> 38:23.360
Their hazmat suits were drenched.

38:23.440 --> 38:25.800
This job requires
great mental and physical strength.

38:25.880 --> 38:27.640
It's not a job for the faint of heart.

38:32.760 --> 38:33.840
It's sensible to think that.

38:33.920 --> 38:35.040
Don't give me that look.

38:37.560 --> 38:39.400
Your mom just interrogated me.

38:39.480 --> 38:41.240
She wanted to know if I was the girl

38:41.320 --> 38:43.800
who was smooching Chen Maidong
at the station.

38:44.320 --> 38:45.400
What did you tell her?

38:45.480 --> 38:46.640
I denied it, of course.

38:47.160 --> 38:48.400
First of all,

38:48.480 --> 38:49.920
I'm that fashionable.

38:50.000 --> 38:50.840
Secondly,

38:50.920 --> 38:52.760
I'm not that open.

38:52.840 --> 38:53.840
Thirdly,

38:53.920 --> 38:55.520
I would never go near him.

38:55.600 --> 38:57.360
Someone would eat me alive for that.

38:58.800 --> 38:59.680
Get lost.

39:00.640 --> 39:02.360
Let's get to the point, Zhuang Jie.

39:02.440 --> 39:04.360
Are you in love with Chen Maidong?

39:09.280 --> 39:10.960
ONE KNEE-LENGTH COAT,
TWO CASHMERE SWEATERS,

39:11.040 --> 39:12.360
ONE HOODIE, TEN PAIRS OF UNDERWEAR

39:12.440 --> 39:13.760
HEIGHT, 185 CM, WEIGHT, 65 KG

39:13.840 --> 39:15.160
What's this?

39:15.240 --> 39:16.440
Are you two planning

39:16.520 --> 39:18.760
to open a fashion store?

39:21.840 --> 39:23.120
Don't be so nosy.

39:23.200 --> 39:24.880
GREAT MAN

39:24.960 --> 39:26.520
Ten pairs of underwear?

39:26.600 --> 39:28.000
You sure aren't shy.

39:28.080 --> 39:30.400
Are we close enough
that I can buy you underwear?

39:31.040 --> 39:31.960
Underwear?

39:35.600 --> 39:36.680
Listen to it.

39:36.760 --> 39:38.200
GREAT MAN

39:38.280 --> 39:40.160
I'm busy. Be serious.

39:41.840 --> 39:44.000
Judging by his voice,
he is wearing a mask.

39:44.080 --> 39:45.760
I guess it's another busy night.

39:55.400 --> 39:56.480
Zhuang Jie,

39:56.560 --> 39:57.640
you're hopeless.

39:58.200 --> 39:59.680
It's not about me.

39:59.760 --> 40:01.920
Chen Maidong is doing perfectly fine.

40:02.480 --> 40:03.520
What do you mean?

40:03.600 --> 40:04.720
Is he not into you?

40:05.320 --> 40:06.360
I guess so.

40:06.440 --> 40:08.600
At least he's not that into me.

40:08.680 --> 40:10.120
He would've said something otherwise.

40:10.200 --> 40:11.920
How else do you want him to put it?

40:12.000 --> 40:13.640
He asked you to get him underwear.

40:13.720 --> 40:16.160
So do you think he sees me as a woman?

40:18.480 --> 40:19.400
Fair enough.

40:21.000 --> 40:23.240
What's the problem with these men?

40:23.880 --> 40:24.720
Never mind.

40:24.800 --> 40:26.400
I'm going back to Shanghai anyway.

40:27.320 --> 40:29.120
It would be troublesome
if we were in love.

40:29.200 --> 40:30.280
I'll treat him

40:30.960 --> 40:32.920
as a friend I can talk to.

40:38.040 --> 40:38.880
Zhuang Jie.

40:39.800 --> 40:41.560
I think

40:41.640 --> 40:43.360
Ji Tong may not have moved on from you.

40:43.440 --> 40:44.760
Forget it.

40:44.840 --> 40:47.400
The best thing about me
is I know my own worth.

40:47.960 --> 40:48.960
I mean it.

40:49.040 --> 40:50.800
On the day I came back,

40:50.880 --> 40:52.160
we had an unpleasant chat.

40:52.240 --> 40:53.480
I told him you had a boyfriend.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.320
And?

40:56.400 --> 41:00.200
And I sent him the picture
of you and Chen Maidong kissing.

41:00.280 --> 41:01.560
Are you serious?

41:01.640 --> 41:03.720
I wanted to get back at him.

41:03.800 --> 41:05.640
But I think he still cares about you.

41:05.720 --> 41:06.560
It's not my concern.

41:07.120 --> 41:08.160
Have you really moved on?

41:08.240 --> 41:09.480
Why would I lie about it?

41:11.640 --> 41:12.480
That's good to hear.

41:13.160 --> 41:14.080
We are still unsure

41:14.160 --> 41:15.920
of what we are looking for.

41:16.000 --> 41:19.040
But at least we know what we should avoid.

41:19.120 --> 41:20.960
Do you know? You're a silly fool.

41:21.040 --> 41:21.920
Listen up.

41:22.000 --> 41:23.160
I can tell the differences.

41:23.240 --> 41:26.080
The guy from the last blind date
is totally someone I should avoid.

41:26.640 --> 41:27.480
That's rare.

41:28.280 --> 41:30.400
That man is in his thirties.

41:30.480 --> 41:32.960
He claimed to be
from a family of TCM practitioners.

41:33.040 --> 41:34.400
But he was so over the top.

41:34.480 --> 41:36.120
He had a whole entourage

41:36.200 --> 41:37.880
as if he were a big shot.

41:37.960 --> 41:39.360
He reminded me of my dad.

41:40.080 --> 41:41.600
And do you know what his name is?

41:41.680 --> 41:43.280
Cui Ge.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.920
Who calls themselves that?

41:47.840 --> 41:50.280
I came across a post online.

41:50.360 --> 41:52.000
Someone was called "Lightning Ball".

41:52.080 --> 41:52.960
It's a real name.

41:54.720 --> 41:55.800
Don't interrupt.

41:56.640 --> 41:58.720
Do you know what the worst part was?

41:59.680 --> 42:01.080
Halfway through the date,

42:01.160 --> 42:02.720
he said he was into me.

42:03.320 --> 42:04.760
He said my looks and elegance

42:04.840 --> 42:07.040
reminded him of his ex-wife a lot.

42:08.080 --> 42:09.560
Who says that kind of thing?

42:09.640 --> 42:10.560
Unbelievable.

42:11.120 --> 42:13.520
There are unspoken rules in blind dates.

42:13.600 --> 42:16.640
He shouldn't go on blind dates
if he doesn't know the rules.

42:16.720 --> 42:18.840
He said I looked like his ex-wife.

42:18.920 --> 42:21.160
Well, he looked like my deadbeat dad.

42:21.240 --> 42:22.320
I felt like punching him.

42:23.160 --> 42:24.640
Had I been tougher,

42:24.720 --> 42:26.600
I would've smashed my glass cup

42:26.680 --> 42:27.760
in his face.

42:28.880 --> 42:29.800
How did you get

42:29.880 --> 42:31.600
such an annoying blind date?

42:31.680 --> 42:33.000
I'm curious.

42:33.080 --> 42:34.640
What's wrong with you now?

42:35.880 --> 42:38.840
I'm speaking from my personal experiences.

42:38.920 --> 42:39.920
Some men

42:40.000 --> 42:42.360
are literally a different species.

42:42.440 --> 42:43.280
True.

42:43.800 --> 42:45.160
I wonder what went wrong

42:45.240 --> 42:46.480
with their minds.

42:50.560 --> 42:51.400
Lightning?

42:51.480 --> 42:52.360
Ball!

42:52.840 --> 42:54.120
Lightning Ball!

42:56.560 --> 42:57.440
Cui…

42:57.520 --> 42:58.720
-Cui Ge!
-Cui Ge!

43:13.160 --> 43:15.360
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

43:41.400 --> 43:42.520
Hello?

43:42.600 --> 43:43.600
Drive safely.

43:43.680 --> 43:45.440
Don't overtake
the funeral parlor's vehicle.

43:47.440 --> 43:48.720
Is that your workplace's vehicle?

43:48.800 --> 43:49.920
I didn't notice.

43:50.000 --> 43:51.000
It's okay.

43:51.560 --> 43:52.800
I'll let it slide.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.000
Don't insult me.

43:54.080 --> 43:55.880
I didn't notice, but I'm not ignorant.

43:57.720 --> 43:58.560
All right.

43:58.640 --> 43:59.520
I'm hanging up.

43:59.600 --> 44:00.600
Focus on driving.

44:01.280 --> 44:02.320
Wait.

44:02.880 --> 44:04.000
Is there a reason

44:04.080 --> 44:05.720
I can't overtake your workplace's vehicle?

44:05.800 --> 44:06.840
Is it bad luck?

44:07.760 --> 44:09.440
Now you're being ignorant.

44:10.240 --> 44:11.480
Well, enlighten me.

44:11.560 --> 44:13.360
The vehicle is now empty.

44:13.920 --> 44:15.800
But if we are working,

44:15.880 --> 44:17.120
the deceased gets priority.

44:17.600 --> 44:18.600
You should make way.

44:20.640 --> 44:21.760
Sorry.

44:21.840 --> 44:23.040
I'll keep this in mind.

44:26.000 --> 44:27.280
You learn from mistakes.

44:27.360 --> 44:28.440
That's a good habit.

44:29.840 --> 44:30.680
So…

44:31.760 --> 44:32.960
Aren't you leaving?

44:36.760 --> 44:37.640
I'll leave.

44:38.360 --> 44:41.080
But I have to settle things at home first.

44:43.800 --> 44:44.880
Okay, bye.

44:48.080 --> 44:49.200
That's rude.

44:52.120 --> 44:53.440
Should I pull over?

44:53.520 --> 44:55.320
Pull over? What for?

44:55.880 --> 44:57.160
So you two can talk.

44:59.120 --> 45:00.720
I can't believe what you just said.

45:01.440 --> 45:03.400
I almost mistook you for Feng Xilun.

45:04.840 --> 45:07.000
I can't stand it

45:07.080 --> 45:08.280
when you don't speak your mind.

45:08.360 --> 45:09.440
Get rid of this habit.

45:14.560 --> 45:17.040
Chen Maidong,
can't you say everything in one go?

45:22.520 --> 45:23.360
Ji Tong?

47:37.440 --> 47:43.800
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
